  "description": "I made some slight adjustments on villager counts to make it more easy to apply. Depending on the map and the opponent you can either go Reignitz or Burgrave.\n\nAim is to endure and use the wonderfull Swabia landmark to close the gap on economy while achieving Fast-Imperial. You need to use your outposts and emergency repairs to endure until you reach this aim.",
